cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lampline in a project, product, paper or talk, please cite it as below and credit Rohan Salvi."
title: "Lampline: open-source, self-hosted voice agents"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted voice agent platform that imports and exports Dialogflow CX and
  CX Agent Studio agents, mixes LLM steps with scripted pages in one agent,
  works with 20 model providers or fully local models, and takes phone calls
  through Twilio, Telnyx or SIP via jambonz. Built on Pipecat.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Salvi
    given-names: Rohan
repository-code: "https://github.com/C4rohan/lampline"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
keywords:
  - voice agents
  - conversational AI
  - Dialogflow CX
  - CX Agent Studio
  - Pipecat
  - self-hosted
